  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop brown onion. Grate carrot.\n• Drain and rinse black beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69cb20419bc4efe70fc5fff0/step-cc769400.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion and carrot, stirring, until softened, 5-6 mins.\n• Add All-American spice blend, beans, the stock powder, brown sugar, water, butter and 1/2 the passata. Stir to combine. Simmer until thickened slightly, 2-3 mins.\n• Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69cb20419bc4efe70fc5fff0/step-32c35210.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat grill to medium-high. Drizzle a baking dish with olive oil.\n• Lay mini flour tortillas on chopping board. Spoon bean mixture down the centre. Roll tortilla up tightly and place, seam-side down, in the baking dish. Repeat with remaining tortillas and bean mixture, ensuring they fit together snugly in the baking dish.\n• Pour remaining passata over rolled tortillas. Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese.\n• Grill enchiladas until cheese is melted and golden and tortillas are warmed through, 8-10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69cb20419bc4efe70fc5fff0/step-7b80e520.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop tomato.\n• In a medium bowl, combine tomato, salad leaves and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste and toss to combine.\n• Divide the enchiladas between plates and serve with salad.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69cb20419bc4efe70fc5fff0/step-ba619730.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
